\b Documenta\b0\par
\par
This program installs Documenta on this server. Documenta is licensed software: using it requires a valid license file, which you upload in the application after installation.\par
\par
The installer enables Windows Subsystem for Linux 2, creates a Linux environment named "documenta", installs Docker inside it and downloads the application. It needs internet access and may ask you to reboot once.\par
\par
By continuing you confirm that you are authorised to install software on this server.\par
